{"schema":1,"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.LayerUniq:11:17","name":"lu_key","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/LayerUniq.lean","lines":[11,23],"atlasRow":412290,"chapter":"1.5992","archiveCommit":"40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005","provenance":{"fileSha256":"ac241f9755ba3bb82412d47b6f40c30f814fb3c373b0e08e3871d5d93529be6d","commandSha256":"4217d2759c4888e03ee07ac8a8fc09660c4940e10266aa93dc24f9706a300c1f"},"source":["private theorem lu_key (L Ω : Type) [Field L] [NumberField L] [Field Ω] [Algebra L Ω] [IsAlgClosure L Ω] (l : ℕ)","    [Fact l.Prime] (hmu : HasMuQ l L) (n : ℕ) (L₁ : Type) [Field L₁] [NumberField L₁] [Algebra L L₁] [Algebra L₁ Ω]","    [IsScalarTower L L₁ Ω] [IsCyclotomicExtension {l ^ n} L L₁] :","    galOf L L₁ Ω = layU l L Ω (n - cZero l L) ∧ Module.finrank L L₁ = l ^ (n - cZero l L) := by","  haveI : IsAlgClosure L₁ Ω := ⟨IsAlgClosure.isAlgClosed L, Algebra.IsAlgebraic.tower_top (K := L) L₁⟩","  have h1 : galOf L L₁ Ω = Un L Ω l n := by","    rw [galOfCyc L Ω l n L L₁, galOf_self]","  have h2 : Un L Ω l n = layU l L Ω (n - cZero l L) := by","    rcases le_total n (cZero l L) with h | h","    · rw [((muQ L Ω l).2.1 n).2 h, layU, ((muQ L Ω l).2.1 _).2 (by omega)]","    · rw [layU, Nat.add_sub_cancel' h]","  refine ⟨h1.trans h2, ?_⟩","  rw [← (galEmbTop L L₁ Ω).2.2, h1, h2, (layerGen L Ω l hmu).1]"],"statementLines":[11,14],"proofLines":[14,23],"assume":["Assume `HasMuQ l L` (hmu)."],"show":"Let ℓ be prime and let the number field L satisfy the prescribed roots-of-unity hypothesis, with base cyclotomic level c₀. Inside a chosen algebraic closure Ω, suppose L₁/L is generated by the ℓⁿth roots of unity. Put m=max(n−c₀,0). The subgroup of Gal(Ω/L) fixing L₁ is the distinguished subgroup at layer m, and [L₁:L]=ℓᵐ.","strategy":"Identify the fixing subgroup through its action on roots of unity. Accounting for the roots already present converts its level into the layer number. Its subgroup index gives the field degree.","steps":[{"id":"g-15-3","number":"⟨1⟩1","kind":"have","claim":"Ω is an algebraic closure of the embedded L₁. It is algebraically closed and every element algebraic over L is also algebraic over L₁.","lines":[15,15],"headLines":[15,15],"snippet":"  haveI : IsAlgClosure L₁ Ω := ⟨IsAlgClosure.isAlgClosed L, Algebra.IsAlgebraic.tower_top (K := L) L₁⟩","uses":[],"refs":[],"typedFact":"IsAlgClosure L₁ Ω","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-16-3","number":"⟨1⟩2","kind":"have","claim":"Because L₁ is generated over L by the ℓⁿth roots, the subgroup of G = Gal(Ω/L) fixing L₁ consists of the automorphisms fixing these roots. Thus Gal(Ω/L₁) = Uₙ = ker(κ modulo ℓⁿ).","lines":[16,17],"headLines":[16,17],"snippet":"  have h1 : galOf L L₁ Ω = Un L Ω l n := by\n    rw [galOfCyc L Ω l n L L₁, galOf_self]","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.KummerTheory.GalOfCyc:5:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Kum.galOfCyc","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/KummerTheory/GalOfCyc.lean","lines":[5,65],"atlasRow":393647,"owner":"1.6298"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.KummerTheory.Mk0IdMapCongr:186:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Kum.Un","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/KummerTheory/Mk0IdMapCongr.lean","lines":[186,186],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6292"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.ConjStableShaFam:43:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.galOf","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/ConjStableShaFam.lean","lines":[43,47],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6302"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.ConjStableShaFam:51:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.galOf_self","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/ConjStableShaFam.lean","lines":[51,53],"atlasRow":393831,"owner":"1.6302"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":"galOf L L₁ Ω = Un L Ω l n","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-18-3","number":"⟨1⟩3","kind":"have","claim":"Put c = c₀(L) and m = max(n−c,0). The congruence subgroup Uₙ equals U_(c+m), the subgroup defining layer m.","lines":[18,21],"headLines":[18,18],"snippet":"  have h2 : Un L Ω l n = layU l L Ω (n - cZero l L) := by","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.KummerTheory.Mk0IdMapCongr:186:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Kum.Un","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/KummerTheory/Mk0IdMapCongr.lean","lines":[186,186],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6292"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:104:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.cZero","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[104,104],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:108:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.layU","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[108,108],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"}],"refs":["g-19-5"],"typedFact":"Un L Ω l n = layU l L Ω (n - cZero l L)","secondRead":false,"children":[{"id":"g-19-5","number":"⟨2⟩1","kind":"cases","claim":"If n ≤ c the roots at both depths n and c already lie in L, and both congruence subgroups are G. If c ≤ n then c+max(n−c,0) = n and the two depths coincide.","lines":[19,21],"headLines":[19,19],"snippet":"    rcases le_total n (cZero l L) with h | h","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:104:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.cZero","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[104,104],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"}],"refs":["g-20-5","g-21-5"],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[{"id":"g-20-5","number":"⟨3⟩1","kind":"rewrite","claim":"If n ≤ c then m = 0. Both Uₙ and U_c are all of G, because L contains the corresponding roots, so Uₙ is the zeroth layer subgroup.","lines":[20,20],"headLines":[20,20],"snippet":"    · rw [((muQ L Ω l).2.1 n).2 h, layU, ((muQ L Ω l).2.1 _).2 (by omega)]","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.CycMemPrincIff:81:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.muQ","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/CycMemPrincIff.lean","lines":[81,104],"atlasRow":412261,"owner":"1.6879"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:108:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.layU","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[108,108],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-21-5","number":"⟨3⟩2","kind":"rewrite","claim":"If c ≤ n then c+(n−c) = n, so the mth layer subgroup U_(c+m) equals Uₙ.","lines":[21,21],"headLines":[21,21],"snippet":"    · rw [layU, Nat.add_sub_cancel' h]","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:108:8","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.layU","kind":"abbrev","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[108,108],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]}]}]},{"id":"g-22-3","number":"⟨1⟩4","kind":"rewrite","claim":"Together these identities give Gal(Ω/L₁) = U_(c+m). Its index in G equals [L₁:L] by the Galois correspondence, and the layer index formula gives [L₁:L] = ℓᵐ.","lines":[22,23],"headLines":[22,23],"snippet":"  refine ⟨h1.trans h2, ?_⟩\n  rw [← (galEmbTop L L₁ Ω).2.2, h1, h2, (layerGen L Ω l hmu).1]","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.GalEmbTop:32:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.galEmbTop","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/GalEmbTop.lean","lines":[32,69],"atlasRow":393887,"owner":"1.6302"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.LayerGen:10:9","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.layerGen","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/LayerGen.lean","lines":[10,39],"atlasRow":412289,"owner":"1.5992"}],"refs":["g-16-3","g-18-3"],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]}],"uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.AdditiveValuationNorms.CokLenLeOfRangeLe:16:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.PropA.IsLevel","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/AdditiveValuationNorms/CokLenLeOfRangeLe.lean","lines":[16,16],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.5992"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.KummerTheory.Mk0IdMapCongr:191:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Kum.Procyc","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/KummerTheory/Mk0IdMapCongr.lean","lines":[191,191],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6292"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.ConjStableShaFam:65:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.galEmb","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/ConjStableShaFam.lean","lines":[65,65],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6302"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.ConjStableShaFam:187:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.levU","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/ConjStableShaFam.lean","lines":[187,187],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6302"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.SelmerTransport.ConjStableShaFam:193:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Base.qExp","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/SelmerTransport/ConjStableShaFam.lean","lines":[193,193],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6302"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GeneratorCountTuples.LemmaK:9:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.HasMuQ","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GeneratorCountTuples/LemmaK.lean","lines":[9,9],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6325"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.LayerUniq:11:17","name":"lu_key","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/LayerUniq.lean","lines":[11,23],"atlasRow":412290,"owner":"1.5992"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.XTwApplyApply:36:5","name":"UpperTheory.V.Tower.IsGen","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/XTwApplyApply.lean","lines":[36,37],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.6879"},{"id":"Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual.Statement:6:8","name":"Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual.G","kind":"abbrev","file":"Formalism/ConjugateSelfDual/Statement.lean","lines":[6,6],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.10481"},{"id":"ReciprocityTheory.GaloisValuations.Global:90:5","name":"ReciprocityTheory.Gal.cycZ","kind":"def","file":"ReciprocityTheory/GaloisValuations/Global.lean","lines":[90,92],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.13895"}],"counts":{"steps":7,"leaves":5,"parents":2,"secondRead":0,"typedFacts":3,"proofLines":10},"coverage":{"leaf":[[15,17],[20,23]],"parent":[[18,19]],"statement":[[